From 697ce902c7f1d53d27357557eca1a540efa9151c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: No <No@ty.com>
Date: Wed, 8 Jul 2026 18:51:02 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Add voice discovery endpoints, identifier voice resolution,
 and stt.engine:none

- GET /audio/voices (+/v1): flat voice-id list (Kokoro-FastAPI-compatible shape)
- GET /audio/voices/all (+/v1): full catalog with id/name/lang/quality per voice
- GET /models (+/v1): static OpenAI-style model list for client health checks
- SpeechController resolves voices via new TTSService.resolveVoice, so AVSpeech
  full identifiers (language variants, enhanced/premium tiers) are accepted
- stt.engine 'none' skips ASR model loading for TTS-only deployments;
  transcription requests return 503

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
